• To create an event that lasts several days, such as a trip, set a daily repeat with an end date.

• Tap the Alarm check box to set an alarm for an event.  An audible tone and an on-screen alert can be set to appear minutes, hours, or days before the event.

• Alarms are silent for untimed events.  For an untimed event, you can set the alarm reminder to appear minutes, hours, or days before midnight (the beginning of the untimed event's day).
